Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:01.49,S,,0,0,0,,SMR.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:05.57,S,,0,0,0,,Tre lettere che senti ogni volta\Nche si parla di nucleare in Italia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:08.49,S,,0,0,0,,Significano Small Modular Reactor:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:10.37,S,,0,0,0,,piccolo reattore modulare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.69,0:00:13.97,S,,0,0,0,,Piccolo, perché produce\Nfino a circa 300 megawatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:16.45,S,,0,0,0,,Una grande centrale\Nne fa più di mille.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:20.55,S,,0,0,0,,Modulare, perché l'idea è costruirlo\Nin fabbrica, a pezzi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.13,S,,0,0,0,,e poi montarlo sul posto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:24.36,S,,0,0,0,,Come si fa con le navi\No con gli aerei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:27.85,S,,0,0,0,,Oggi in Occidente non ce n'è\Nancora nessuno in funzione.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:32.20,S,,0,0,0,,Il primo dovrebbe accendersi in Canada,\Na Darlington, nel 2030.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:33.21,S,,0,0,0,,E in Italia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:36.75,S,,0,0,0,,Il governo parla\Ndel 2033-2035.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:42.18,S,,0,0,0,,Come funziona, quanto costa e chi li costruisce:\Nlo trovi su Atomo e Orbita.
